  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 7.72,
      "e": 8.86,
      "text": "- We're doing MAFTD fires today."
    },
    {
      "s": 8.86,
      "e": 11.14,
      "text": "Getting the marines situated and familiarized"
    },
    {
      "s": 11.14,
      "e": 13.97,
      "text": "^with actually being with real fire"
    },
    {
      "s": 14.02,
      "e": 17.16,
      "text": "^with the MAFTD and in an aircraft situation."
    },
    {
      "s": 17.16,
      "e": 18.66,
      "text": "The MAFTD gives us the opportunity"
    },
    {
      "s": 18.66,
      "e": 21.2,
      "text": "to actually put them in that situation,"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.2,
      "e": 24.55,
      "text": "what it might be like if an aircraft were to crash land."
    },
    {
      "s": 24.55,
      "e": 25.84,
      "text": "So anything that happens on the airfield,"
    },
    {
      "s": 25.84,
      "e": 26.93,
      "text": "Crash Fire Rescue is there"
    },
    {
      "s": 26.93,
      "e": 28.84,
      "text": "to support emergency medical services-wise,"
    },
    {
      "s": 28.84,
      "e": 31.13,
      "text": "structural and aircraft emergencies,"
    },
    {
      "s": 31.13,
      "e": 33.91,
      "text": "so anything that happens in the air or on Bogue,"
    },
    {
      "s": 33.91,
      "e": 35.82,
      "text": "that's gonna be us responding."
    }
